<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>Confirm your ASComply account</title>
<style>
a{color:#0d5d4c}
@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.px{padding-left:24px!important;padding-right:24px!important}.h1 h1{font-size:30px!important;line-height:36px!important}.stack{display:block!important;width:100%!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#faf8f2;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%">
<span style="display:none;visibility:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;height:0;width:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all">Confirm your email address to finish setting up your ASComply workspace.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;</span>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#faf8f2" style="background:#faf8f2"><tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="width:100%;max-width:600px"><tr><td class="px" style="background:#faf8f2;padding:28px 48px 24px 48px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="auto" style="width:autopx;"><tr><td width="36" style="width:36px"><img src="https://api.ascomply.com/emails/mark.png" width="36" height="36" alt="ASComply" style="display:block;border:0;border-radius:6px;width:36px;height:36px"></td><td  style="padding-left:10px"><div style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#0b3032;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em">ASComply</div><div style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:8px;line-height:10px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.8px">AFRICA</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#082f31" style="background:#082f31"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td height="48" style="height:48px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding-left:48px;padding-right:48px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="auto" style="width:autopx;"><tr><td width="24" style="width:24px;border-top:1px solid #bfd3c7;font-size:0;line-height:0;height:1px">&nbsp;</td><td  style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:12px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#bfd3c7;font-weight:700;padding-left:10px;letter-spacing:1.35px;text-transform:uppercase">Registration</td></tr></table><div style="height:20px;line-height:20px;font-size:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">&nbsp;</div><div class="h1"><h1 style="margin:0;font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:36px;line-height:42px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#f7f6ed;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.04em">You are registered.<br><span style="color:#f5bb86">Confirm your email to continue.</span></h1></div><div style="height:20px;line-height:20px;font-size:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">&nbsp;</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%"><tr><td style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:28px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#bbcdc7;font-weight:400;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere">Hi Ada Obi, your ASComply account for Obi Partners has been created. Confirm ada@obi.test to open your workspace.</td></tr></table><div style="height:28px;line-height:28px;font-size:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">&nbsp;</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="auto" style="width:autopx;"><tr><td bgcolor="#f5bc88" style="background:#f5bc88;border-radius:7px"><a href="https://api.example.test/auth/verify?token=t1&amp;type=signup&amp;redirect_to=" style="display:block;padding:14px 26px;font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#163c35;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">Confirm email address</a></td></tr></table><div style="height:16px;line-height:16px;font-size:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">&nbsp;</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#bbcdc7;font-weight:400;">This link expires in 24 hours.</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td height="48" style="height:48px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#faf8f2" style="background:#faf8f2"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td height="40" style="height:40px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding-left:48px;padding-right:48px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dce7e4;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 24px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td width="120" style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:600;padding:12px 0;width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce7e4">Organisation</td><td style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#0b3032;font-weight:600;padding:12px 0;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;border-bottom:1px solid #dce7e4">Obi Partners</td></tr><tr><td width="120" style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:600;padding:12px 0;width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce7e4">Email</td><td style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#0b3032;font-weight:600;padding:12px 0;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;border-bottom:1px solid #dce7e4">ada@obi.test</td></tr><tr><td width="120" style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:600;padding:12px 0;width:120px">Role</td><td style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#0b3032;font-weight:600;padding:12px 0;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere">Admin</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><div style="height:40px;line-height:40px;font-size:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">&nbsp;</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="auto" style="width:autopx;"><tr><td width="24" style="width:24px;border-top:1px solid #073c3d;font-size:0;line-height:0;height:1px">&nbsp;</td><td  style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:12px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#073c3d;font-weight:700;padding-left:10px;letter-spacing:1.35px;text-transform:uppercase">What happens next</td></tr></table><div style="height:14px;line-height:14px;font-size:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">&nbsp;</div><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:32px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#0b3032;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.04em">Three steps to your first validated invoice.</h2><div style="height:12px;line-height:12px;font-size:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">&nbsp;</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td width="32" style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#527c6a;font-weight:700;padding:12px 16px 12px 0;width:32px;letter-spacing:1.3px;vertical-align:top">01</td><td  style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:400;padding:12px 0;vertical-align:top"><strong style="color:#0b3032">Confirm your email</strong><br>Use the button above to activate your account.</td></tr><tr><td width="32" style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#527c6a;font-weight:700;padding:12px 16px 12px 0;width:32px;letter-spacing:1.3px;vertical-align:top">02</td><td  style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:400;padding:12px 0;vertical-align:top"><strong style="color:#0b3032">Add your company</strong><br>Enter your company's name and TIN.</td></tr><tr><td width="32" style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#527c6a;font-weight:700;padding:12px 16px 12px 0;width:32px;letter-spacing:1.3px;vertical-align:top">03</td><td  style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:400;padding:12px 0;vertical-align:top"><strong style="color:#0b3032">Upload an invoice</strong><br>ASComply checks each field and shows any errors before submission.</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td height="16" style="height:16px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#faf8f2" style="background:#faf8f2"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding-left:48px;padding-right:48px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td bgcolor="#eff6f4" style="background:#eff6f4;border-radius:6px;padding:18px 20px"><div style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase">Button not working?</div><div style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:400;padding-top:6px;word-break:break-all">Copy this link into your browser:<br><a href="https://api.example.test/auth/verify?token=t1&amp;type=signup&amp;redirect_to=" style="color:#0d5d4c">https://api.example.test/auth/verify?token=t1&amp;type=signup&amp;redirect_to=</a></div></td></tr></table><div style="height:20px;line-height:20px;font-size:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:400;">If you did not register, ignore this email. No account is activated until the address is confirmed.</div></td></tr><tr><td height="40" style="height:40px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td  style="background:#faf8f2"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%"><tr><td height="36" style="height:36px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding-left:48px;padding-right:48px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="auto" style="width:autopx;"><tr><td width="36" style="width:36px"><img src="https://api.ascomply.com/emails/mark.png" width="36" height="36" alt="ASComply" style="display:block;border:0;border-radius:6px;width:36px;height:36px"></td><td  style="padding-left:10px"><div style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#0b3032;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em">ASComply</div><div style="font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:8px;line-height:10px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.8px">AFRICA</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td height="18" style="height:18px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding-left:48px;padding-right:48px;font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:19px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#536b6d;font-weight:400;">ASComply is an invoice compliance workflow platform. It does not replace your accounting system.<br><br>You received this email because an account was created with this address.<br><br>ASComply Africa · Lagos, Nigeria</td></tr><tr><td height="14" style="height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding-left:48px;padding-right:48px;font-family:Manrope,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:19px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#0d5d4c;font-weight:700;"><a href="https://www.ascomply.com/privacy" style="color:#0d5d4c;text-decoration:underline">Privacy</a></td></tr><tr><td height="36" style="height:36px;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
